"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Patients with chronic heart failure\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"of New York Heart Association Class II or III\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"a left ventricular ejection fraction of = 40%\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"for patients in NYHA class II\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or = 45% for patients in NYHA class III\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              },\n              \"right\": {\n                \"AND\": {\n                  \"left\": {\n                    \"raw_text\": \"a hemoglobin level at the screening visit between 9.5-13.5 g/dl\"\n                  },\n                  \"right\": {\n                    \"AND\": {\n                      \"left\": {\n                        \"raw_text\": \"and iron deficiency, which is defined as\"\n                      },\n                      \"right\": {\n                        \"AND\": {\n                          \"left\": {\n                            \"raw_text\": \"serum ferritin level < 100µg/l\"\n                          },\n                          \"right\": {\n                            \"OR\": {\n                              \"left\": {\n                                \"raw_text\": \